+- **Purple buttons** = Export features
+- **Orange buttons** = Statistics & info
+
+### Notifications
+- Success: Green background
+- Error: Red background
+- Warning: Orange background
+- Auto-dismiss after 3 seconds
+
+---
+
+## 📱 How to Reload the Extension
